Files: media/models/*.glb media/portraits/*.jpg models-src/*
Copyright: 2026 Ishtaria Team <ishtaria@vitexsoftware.com>
License: CC-BY-SA-4.0
Comment: Character models are built by models-src/build_models.py (Blender); their fabric and fur textures and
 the backdrops were generated with InvokeAI (RealVisXL_V4.0). The portraits are renders of the models
 (tools/render_portraits.py). Design after research/CHARACTER_DESIGN.md.

Files: media/models/ishtar.glb media/portraits/ishtar.jpg models-src/ishtar/* models-src/pilot/*
Copyright: 2026 Ishtaria Team <ishtaria@vitexsoftware.com>
License: CC-BY-SA-4.0
Comment: The goddess Ishtar is a generated mesh: a concept image made with InvokeAI (Juggernaut XL v9) was turned
 into a 3D model by Hyper3D Rodin (Gen-2.5-High), then retopologised, rigged and animated by
 models-src/rodin_rig.py (settings in models-src/rodin/ishtar.json). The star disc, the quiver and the blend
 shapes are added by that script. The terms of use of Hyper3D (ownership of and rights to generated
 assets under the plan used) must be checked before the model is distributed outside this project.

