Comment: Like Ishtar, these characters are generated meshes: concept images made with InvokeAI (Juggernaut XL v9,
 models-src/rodin/make_concepts.py) were turned into 3D models by Hyper3D Rodin (Gen-2.5-High; generation ids in
 models-src/rodin/generations.txt), then retopologised, rigged and animated by models-src/rodin_rig.py (settings in
 models-src/rodin/<id>.json). Gilgamesh comes from the earlier pilot. The terms of use of Hyper3D must be checked
 before distribution.

