Copyright: 2026 Ishtaria Team <ishtaria@vitexsoftware.com>
License: CC-BY-SA-4.0
Comment: The eight citizens of Uruk (villagers, townspeople, nobles) are made like Ishtar: concept images from InvokeAI
 (Juggernaut XL v9, models-src/rodin/make_concepts.py and img2img_concept.py), turned into 3D models by Hyper3D Rodin (Gen-2.5-High),
 then rigged by models-src/rodin_rig.py. The terms of use of Hyper3D must be checked before distribution.

Files: media/models/scorpion_man.glb media/models/bull_of_heaven.glb media/portraits/scorpion_man.jpg media/portraits/bull_of_heaven.jpg
 models-src/scorpion_man/* models-src/bull_of_heaven/* models-src/rodin/scorpion_man.json models-src/rodin/bull_of_heaven.json
Copyright: 2026 Ishtaria Team <ishtaria@vitexsoftware.com>
License: CC-BY-SA-4.0
Comment: The two creatures are generated meshes: the Bull of Heaven from one InvokeAI concept, the Scorpion Man assembled by
 models-src/rodin_scorpion_assemble.py from two Rodin meshes (a giant scorpion and the upper body of a bearded man, each from
 its own InvokeAI concept), all made by Hyper3D Rodin (Gen-2.5-High) and rigged by models-src/rodin_rig_creature.py. The terms
 of use of Hyper3D must be checked before distribution.

Files: media/models/architecture/ziggurat_etemenanki.glb media/models/architecture/etemenanki_precinct.glb
 media/models/architecture/uruk_walls.glb
 media/models/architecture/ziggurat_anu.glb media/models/architecture/ishtar_gate.glb
 media/models/architecture/processional_way.glb models-src/architecture/*
Copyright: 2026 Ishtaria Team <ishtaria@vitexsoftware.com>
License: CC-BY-SA-4.0
Comment: Built by models-src/architecture/ziggurat.py (Blender). The brick, glaze, plaster and paving textures
 were generated with InvokeAI (Juggernaut XL v9) and made seamless by make_tileable.py. The designs follow the
 reconstructions described in research/ZIGGURATS.md and research/ISHTAR_GATE.md; no published illustration was copied or used
 as a reference image. The animal reliefs of the Ishtar Gate are new drawings generated for this datadisk.

